# sys-gym-eterna (docs/research/gym-puzzles.md): Eterna Gym's flower clock.
# Each trainer won advances the clock (advance_eterna_gym_clock): the camera walks to the clock, the hands
# turn two minutes a tick, the collision mask and hour-hand jump change; after trainers two and three the
# camera shows a fountain draining and the message waits for A. The route needs each state's mask: up the
# minute-hand corridor after trainer one (jump at 11,18), across the middle after two (jump at 6,13), the
# right fountain open after two, the left after three. A save round trip after trainer one, and leaving and
# re-entering after trainer two: the slot is cleared by the warp and rebuilt from
# VAR_ETERNA_GYM_FLOWER_CLOCK_STATE. Gardenia's battle ends at the leader state.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_CHARIZARD 50 platinum:MOVE_FLAMETHROWER
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY_GYM 11 26 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 11 22
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press right
until position 13 22
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
battle auto 20000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_LASS_CAROLINE won
advance text
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_ETERNA_GYM_TRAINERS_BEATEN 1
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_ETERNA_GYM_FLOWER_CLOCK_STATE 1
+0 assert state mapFeatures {"kind": "eterna-gym", "clock": 1}
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state mapFeatures {"kind": "eterna-gym", "clock": 1}
+0 press up
until position 13 21
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press left
until position 11 21
+0 release left
until idle
+0 press up
until position 11 19
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 11 17
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 11 13
+0 release up
until idle
+0 screenshot eterna-clock
+0 press right
until position 19 13
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press down
until position 19 18
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press right
until position 20 18
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
battle auto 20000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_AROMA_LADY_JENNA won
advance text
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_ETERNA_GYM_TRAINERS_BEATEN 2
+0 assert state mapFeatures {"kind": "eterna-gym", "clock": 2}
+0 press down
until position 20 23
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press left
until position 19 23
+0 release left
until idle
+0 press down
until position 19 26
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press left
until position 11 26
+0 release left
until idle
+0 press down
+1 release down
until idle
# leave and come back: the warp clears the slot, the gym's onTransition selects it again at 0, and the map
# load rebuilds the clock from its var
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY"
+0 release down
until idle
+0 assert state mapFeatures null
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY_GYM"
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert state mapFeatures {"kind": "eterna-gym", "clock": 2}
+0 press up
until position 11 21
+0 release up
